Gap\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Choose Youth Face Beauty Cream</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Youth Face Beauty Cream is formulated with Kojic Acid &amp; Alpha Arbutin, two ingredients widely used in skincare for helping improve the look of uneven skin tone and dark spots with consistent use. It's made and shipped from India by Beauty Mart, and every jar is the same original formula whether you choose a single jar or a value pack.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:14px;margin:20px 0;\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center;padding:16px 10px;background:#fdece9;border-radius:12px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:1.4em;margin-bottom:6px;\">🧪</div>\n<div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.85em;margin-bottom:4px;\">Kojic Acid &amp; Alpha Arbutin</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:0.78em;color:#666;margin:0;line-height:1.4;\">A trusted skincare combination for uneven tone and dark spots.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;padding:16px 10px;background:#fdece9;border-radius:12px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:1.4em;margin-bottom:6px;\">🇮🇳</div>\n<div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.85em;margin-bottom:4px;\">Made &amp; Shipped from India</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:0.78em;color:#666;margin:0;line-height:1.4;\">Produced by Beauty Mart, Bhatkal, Karnataka. Ships across India.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;padding:16px 10px;background:#fdece9;border-radius:12px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:1.4em;margin-bottom:6px;\">✅</div>\n<div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.85em;margin-bottom:4px;\">Cash on Delivery Available</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:0.78em;color:#666;margin:0;line-height:1.4;\">Order with confidence — pay when it arrives at your door.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;padding:16px 10px;background:#fdece9;border-radius:12px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:1.4em;margin-bottom:6px;\">💬</div>\n<div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.85em;margin-bottom:4px;\">Real Support on WhatsApp</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:0.78em;color:#666;margin:0;line-height:1.4;\">Questions before you order? Message us directly on WhatsApp.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n  <div class=\"dsgo-shape-divider dsgo-shape-divider--bottom is-shape-inherit is-flip-y\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:designsetgo/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"760px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":6,\"className\":\"is-style-eyebrow\"} -->\n<h6 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-eyebrow\">Skincare Guide</h6>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Youth Face Beauty Cream: What to Know Before You Buy</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Youth Face Beauty Cream is built around two well-known skincare actives — Kojic Acid and Alpha Arbutin — combined into a single daily-use cream. If you're comparing pack sizes or wondering how it fits into your routine, here's a straightforward look at what's in the jar and how people typically use it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What's Inside: Kojic Acid &amp; Alpha Arbutin</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kojic Acid and Alpha Arbutin are two of the most studied ingredients in skin-tone-focused skincare. Both are commonly used to help improve the appearance of uneven skin tone and dark spots with regular, consistent use over time. Youth Face Beauty Cream combines them into one formula so you don't need to layer multiple separate products.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Use It in Your Daily Routine</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cleanse your face and pat it dry.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Apply a small amount of Youth Face Beauty Cream evenly over your face and neck.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Follow with sunscreen during the day, since brightening actives can increase sun sensitivity.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Choosing Between Pack of 1, 2, and 3</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Pack of 1 (25g) is a good way to try Youth Face Beauty Cream for the first time. The Pack of 2 and Pack of 3 are meant for people who already use it regularly and want to stock up so they don't run out mid-routine — each jar is the exact same formula, just more of it in one order.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ordering From Youth Face</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Youth Face Beauty Cream is made and shipped from India and can be ordered directly from this page with Cash on Delivery available. If you have questions before ordering — about the product, an existing order, or anything else — you can reach us directly on <a href=\"https://wa.me/919980881230\">WhatsApp: 9980881230</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:designsetgo/section {\"shapeDividerBottom\":\"inherit\",\"className\":\"is-style-shape-divider airo-section-5435c620-0b0e-469c-8631-e6de6c066fdf is-style-section-1\",\"align\":\"full\",\"contentWidth\":\"600px\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"